{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7IvorGMN12GMNCustomTagV","modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"title":"GMNCustomTag","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNCustomTag"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNCustomTag"}],"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNCustomTag"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the payload of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/custom(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", one of the two untyped lanes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the tag model, and it is exactly the shape every tag had before the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"model was typed: a name, an optional identifier, a flat list of parameters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a body of scoped symbols. Nothing here is interpreted — the parameters"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are whatever was written, in the order they were written, bound to nothing."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is how GMN accommodates third-party extension: a name outside its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reserved vocabulary is not an error, but a custom tag that round-trips"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"intact and realizes as a no-op, ready for a consumer or a downstream tool"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to give it meaning."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"What-lands-here","text":"What lands here"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A name outside GMN’s reserved vocabulary: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\bembel"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\splitChord"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\shortFermata"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\chord"},{"type":"text","text":", and anything a consumer invents. Nothing reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what was written to such a tag, so there is no schema to bind against and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing to model. It round-trips byte for byte and realizes as a no-op."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"What-does-not-land-here","text":"What does not land here"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A reserved name that failed to promote is "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/reserved(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this. The distinction is enforced by "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/init(ident:name:parameters:body:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which fails for a reserved name — so a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GMNCustomTag"},{"type":"text","text":" never carries a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reserved name, at any stage, and the case cannot be used as a general"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"escape hatch."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Guido Music Notation tag whose name GMN does not reserve, carried in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its untyped, as-written form."}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/init(ident:name:parameters:body:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/body","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/ident-swift.property","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/name-swift.property","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/parameters"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"title":"Type Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/Ident-swift.typealias","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/Name-swift.typealias","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/Parameter"],"anchor":"Type-Aliases"},{"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/Equatable-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Tags","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag"],"anchor":"Tags"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmncustomtag"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://IvorGMN/documentation/IvorGMN":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Guido Music Notation parser, normal